 We also provide a range of protective security services to other government agencies.\n          </p>\n\n        \n\n        \n      </div>\n\n    \n\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"hero-desktop\">\n    \n      <img class=\"hero-image\" src=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FitMaxWzg2NSw5NTBd.jpg\" alt=\"Blurred out people walking in CBD\">\n    \n\n    \n      \n\n        <div class=\"hero-report\">\n          <h3 class=\"hero-report-heading\"><a href=\"/contact-us/reporting-a-national-security-concern\" >Report a national security concern</a></h3>\n          <p class=\"hero-report-description\">Your information could help us protect New Zealand from threats such as foreign interference, espionage and terrorism.</p>\n        </div>\n\n      \n    \n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n  <div class=\"hero-mobile\">\n    \n  <picture>\n\t\n\t<!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]-->\n\t\n\t<source media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" srcset=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzg2NSw5NTBd.jpg\">\n\t\n\t<source media=\"(min-width: 625px)\" srcset=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzc2Nyw3MDNd.jpg\">\n\t\n\t<source media=\"(min-width: 577px)\" srcset=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzg2NSw5MDNd.jpg\">\n\t\n\t<source media=\"(min-width: 400px)\" srcset=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzU3Niw1NTBd.jpg\">\n\t\n\t<source media=\"(min-width: 321px)\" srcset=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzQyMCw2MDBd.jpg\">\n\t\n\t<!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]-->\n\t<img src=\"/assets/Uploads/NZSIS_Peopleonstreet_1594x1752px_v2__FillWzMyMCw0NDdd.jpg\" alt=\"NZSIS Peopleonstreet 1594x1752px v2\">\n</picture>\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    <div class=\"hero-report\">\n      <h3 class=\"hero-report-heading\"><a href=\"/contact-us/reporting-a-national-security-concern\" >Report a national security concern</a></h3>\n      <p class